{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42910","headline":"和訾家洲宴游 · 陆弘休","name":"和訾家洲宴游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新春蘂绽訾家洲，信是南方最胜游。\n酒满百分殊不怕，人添一岁更堪愁。\n莺声暗逐歌声艳，花态还随舞态羞。\n莫惜今朝同酩酊，任他龟鹤与蜉蝣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆弘休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42910.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42910","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}